    <string name="menu_back">Back</string>
    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="app_description">In 2022, I made a simple app to experiment with Jetpack Compose and keep track of the time until my new house would be delivered by the contractor. In 2025, I started this iteration to keep track of the time until my exit from corporate work. I decided to make it generic so people can any event they like. I was inspired by the Facebook notes feature to add an emoji to represent the countdown. I hope you like my app and find it useful to keep track of what\'s important to you.\n\n— jmo</string>
